    <para id="para-00055">Quan, C., Costigan, C. L., &amp; Kobayashi, K. M. (2022). Ethnic and national identity development processes: The role of cultural behaviors and gender. <emphasis effect="italics">Cultural Diversity and Ethnic Minority Psychology, 28</emphasis>(1), 1–12. https://doi.org/10.1037/cdp0000475</para>
